─── app/static/bag-search.css:1378-1378 ───
[style · low] `margin-left: 6px` only makes sense for an inline flow, but this badge is always
rendered as a direct child of the column-flex `.bag-scene-cell` (see bags.html). As a flex item it
won't sit beside the label/history pills — the margin just shifts it 6px to the right of every other
left-aligned pill in the column, producing an inconsistent left edge even after `align-self:
flex-start` is added. If the intent is a stacked pill, drop the margin; if it should appear inline
next to the scene label, the markup needs a row wrapper (e.g., group it with
`.bag-scene-label`/`.bag-scene-history` in a `display: flex` line).


